WEBVTT

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:07.920
The following program is intended
for mature audiences

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.630
and contains Adult Content,
Graphic Language, Graphic Violence,

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.800
Brief Nudity
and Strong Sexual Content including rape.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.150
-Father!
-Ryo!

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:33.530
Makie!

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:36.320
Makie!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.920
No good. They're in the cliff's shadow now.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.210
Did you kill them or not? What happened to Habaki?

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:51.260
The young girl covered him and they collapsed.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.340
Fire!

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:53.380
No can do.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:59.890
Mr. Hanabusa, the excuse is that he
just happened to be in the vicinity of the Itto-ryu.

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:04.440
Without that guise, would you still fire upon the
Shogunate?

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:08.110
Especially upon one under orders of seppuku?

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:11.780
He's a villain who left the gates accompanied by
criminals!

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:15.150
Very much like yourself at the moment, Mr. Hanabusa.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:19.070
In fact, shouldn't you be a bit more understanding now

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:21.950
of the feelings of a man who faces seppuku.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:30.880
Why? Why must I...?

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:34.130
Even when I...

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:38.640
desired peace for Edo more earnestly than anyone?

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:50.900
Blade of the Immortal

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:38.890
He won.

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:41.350
Mr. Manji won.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:00.410
Why...? Why let me go?

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:10.000
I'd applaud you if you think you can cross that sea with
those wounds.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.720
Someday, my descendants will

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:17.640
deliver to this nation the threat of war.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:22.680
You died. That's what I'll tell her.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:27.020
Don't show your face before Rin ever again, slant-eyes.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:31.020
Yes. Rest assured.

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:19.240
Rin!

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:26.540
Itto-ryu...

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:31.420
Like the unbounded Pacific, ever free.

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.550
We championed...

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:39.050
the prosperity of combat
and the reinvigoration of the sword.

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:41.800
And by that sword...

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:44.680
even if only an iota...

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:48.270
perhaps something has changed.

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:54.110
I wanted someone to confirm that for themselves.

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:58.650
Be it 10, even 100 years from now.

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:03.990
That is why I called you here.

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.660
Killer of 100.

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:11.380
Immortal man...

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.300
I won't forget about it.

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:09.020
You catch on quickly, Mr. Magatsu.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:13.690
I come from farmers, myself. It's more interesting than
swinging a sword.

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:17.020
Hey! How about you take a little break?

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:25.570
So you returned to Edo in the end. Aren't you afraid of
the Shogunate?

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:29.660
Habaki and Hanabusa are both dead.
I won't be caught now.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:35.920
Besides, I never had a mind to board that ship with
captain Anotsu in the first place.

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:39.050
I just rub the wrong way with anyone who's a samurai.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.470
I liked our leader.

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:46.300
But in the end our paths simply parted.
That's how I felt.

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:47.930
I see.

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:48.970
Most importantly...

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:52.560
it won't be there across the sea.

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.230
Ren's grave, that is.

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:07.660
Don't you feel like forgiving her yet?

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.450
I don't know.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:17.540
I just want to make a living by this,
as quickly as possible.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:23.550
Curse that kid!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:26.640
He's stolen all of master's favor right out from under me!

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.800
Renzo is so talented.

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:30.970
All right already, out of the way.

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:43.360
What is it?

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:47.360
Are you an acquaintance of my grandfather's?

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:48.530
Yes, I suppose.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:52.410
He hasn't been leading an honest life.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.910
And now he's neared the end.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.870
Do you need something?

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.130
No.

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:04.760
Please take care of him.

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.970
HIGO PROVINCE
SHIMABARA DOMAIN

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.220
Isaku!

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:17.230
Look, look at this!

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:20.020
Help me with the harvest, Doa.

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.950
Ozuhan!

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:30.120
Huh, what?

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.410
You can speak words now?

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:37.410
Never mind.

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:48.220
I can't even send you off? How cold of you.

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:52.050
ASANO FAMILY
LEADER

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.930
Are you really going on this journey?

00:14:56.730 --> 00:15:01.400
Yes. I'm going to seek out
as many families of Itto-ryu members...

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:06.190
that Mr. Manji and I killed
and apologize to them.

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:11.200
Honestly, I thought you were going to let him go free,

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:13.410
Kagehisa Anotsu.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:15.450
Of course not.

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:19.870
When Kagehisa Anotsu uttered
those words back then, "descendants."

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:23.290
That's when I felt it clearly.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:26.380
That I can't leave the root of the problem
for the next generation.

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:29.550
I have to break the chain of curses here and now.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:33.720
I must not let this man live.

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:41.140
With Sir Habaki's fall from grace,
you're left without rebuke.

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:45.820
Mr. Manji, who accomplished just that,
got off with banishment from Edo.

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:49.780
Well, I guess we should be happy about that.
But are you sure about this?

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:54.370
If you go on a journey as well, won't you need
another bodyguard?

00:15:56.240 --> 00:16:02.330
On this journey, there are no Kagimura Habakis
or Kagehisa Anotsus.

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:07.630
It's a journey on which
not a single person will be killed.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:12.010
People who weep over their lack of power,

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:16.260
people who can't sleep at night
with the loss of their loved ones,

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:21.640
those are the kinds of people
I believe should be at his side.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:25.190
That's no longer me.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:27.690
I'm...

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:32.530
Let's go, Miss Hyakurin.

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:36.240
Yeah.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:50.800
What is it? Is it the baby?

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:58.100
"What is it? Is it the baby?" Are you dumb?

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:03.060
You're asking about the baby?
As a middle aged woman, the way I see it,

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:08.360
don't get ahead of yourself trying to worry about others.

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:12.400
A kid needs to be a kid, being frivolous, worrying about
what to eat.

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:15.780
Saying what they want, causing a scene and such.

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:30.770
JAPANESE - WESTERN
CONFECTIONERY

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:39.530
Digging holes in the riverbank will get you
yelled at by the authorities.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:45.040
I've been seeing a lot of you lately, granny.

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:51.880
It's been 80 years since the Shogunate ended.
Where have you been?

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:57.880
Where? Nowhere, really. I've just been
wandering Japan in my idleness.

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:04.640
I was in a shipwreck in Tosa while fishing
and was rescued by an American ship.

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:10.440
I thought I'd get to finally return home after 12 years,
then I was thrown in a jail in Hagi.

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:17.110
That's right, some Itto-ryu-like guys
in Kyoto picked a fight too.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:19.490
I got put through the wringer.

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:28.830
The name Itto-ryu hasn't passed my lips
in about 90 years now.

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:32.920
Oh, yeah, it's all coming back to me. The Itto-ryu...

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:36.800
I can't remember their names or faces.

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:43.260
I wonder how she'd feel if she could see it, this era.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:50.850
So what do you want, granny? Did you have some
business with me today?

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:54.610
Ah, yes. Come on over.

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:06.700
She's the grandchild of an old friend.
Her name is Fuyu.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:11.710
This friend runs a sword dojo in Honjo
and has two sons.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:15.340
This girl's father and his brother

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:18.960
are in a heated dispute over leadership of the family.

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:21.470
I want you to protect her for a while.

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:25.300
Are you doing marketing
for bodyguards now, granny?

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:27.720
Why should I have to...?

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:32.440
Here.

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.480
Mom gave me this.

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:42.950
-Was your mom someone I know?
-No.

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:47.700
Mom said she got it from Grandma.

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:51.580
And Grandma got it from Grandma's grandma.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:55.710
I was told to give this to the man in the picture
when I met him.

00:20:55.790 --> 00:20:56.920
WANTED

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:00.090
That thing has seen some years.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:07.050
How about it, Fuyu? Won't you go with this man?

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:08.810
Hey, granny, what do think you're--?

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:26.450
Just when I come back to Edo
thinking I could start as a salaried man...

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:30.950
There you go speaking trifles.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:35.790
Anyway, I think it best if you left Tokyo
this very morning.

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:38.040
I'm counting on you, Manji.

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:42.670
Do strive to protect that girl with everything you have

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:45.970
in this era which swords are not swung.

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:52.060
You may find it much more challenging
than slaying 1,000 evildoers.

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:06.450
Are you okay? Don't cry, all right?

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:09.070
Come on.

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:12.040
What?

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:13.830
Your pinky...

00:22:15.370 --> 00:22:17.080
It was...

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:27.050
Funny, thanks to you, I finally remembered her name.

00:22:44.400 --> 00:22:46.070
Want to ride the horsecar?

00:22:48.570 --> 00:22:51.660
I see. Well, the road ahead is a long one.

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:50.840
Final Act - Blade of the Immortal
